        "title": "Add streak milestone sharing types and placement to common",
        "summary": "The shared constants and types packages gain support for the `streak_share_2026_11` experiment, which lets a workspace offer to share a reached streak milestone via social media. A new `streak` entry is added to `REFERRAL_INVITE_VIA` so the streak dialog's invite links are tracked distinctly from other placements, and `ReferralInviteAction` extends with `posted_x` and `posted_linkedin` to capture those social share events. The `workspacePreferencesSchema` adds an optional `streakShareShownThrough` integer (max 100000) to remember the highest milestone shown per account, while `FreebuffStreakResponse` gains a `shareMilestone` field that freebuff.com's `/api/web/streak` endpoint sets for the share arm.",
